KV cache estimate for mamba.gguf (mamba)

  block_count    64
  head_count     0
  head_count_kv  0      no attention heads
  key_length     0      unused: no layer has KV heads
  value_length   0      unused: no layer has KV heads
  cache type     f16    2 bytes per element
  context        8,192  tokens per sequence
  sequences      1

formula
  K per layer and token = row_size(f16, 0 x 0 = 0) = 0 B
  V per layer and token = row_size(f16, 0 x 0 = 0) = 0 B
  total = sequences x ctx x block_count x (K + V)
        = 1 x 8,192 x 64 x 0 B
        = 0 B

notes
  - recurrent (SSM) state is not included
  - 64 layers have no KV heads
